  },
  &quot;object&quot;: {
    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;session&quot;,
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;5d64bc26-5f63-4280-9a57-54b4cf2fbb98&quot;
  },
  &quot;result&quot;: {
    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;success&quot;,
    &quot;reason&quot;: null
  },
  &quot;correlation&quot;: {
    &quot;correlation_id&quot;: &quot;c0be36a8-b9fa-4719-8496-0d8fcab0f273&quot;,
    &quot;trace_id&quot;: &quot;4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736&quot;,
    &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;89902ade-eab6-47b3-9e6e-7b75a895c192&quot;
  }
}
</code></pre><p>Пример отказа, когда сотрудника установить не удалось:</p><pre><code class="language-json">{
  &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;b3f1c2a0-3b4e-4c5a-9f21-77e0a1b2c3d4&quot;,
  &quot;schema_version&quot;: &quot;1.0&quot;,
  &quot;occurred_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-07T09:01:00.000Z&quot;,
